<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 351 0 R
/E (SHS welcomes nearly 4000 visitors annually to learn about the history of the Old Brunswick County Jail.  A team of 37 volunteer docents provide guided  group or private tours of the jail. They share the history of the building which served Brunswick County for more than 70 years, from 1904 to 1978, first as a jail and then as Sheriff offices. Their knowledge and enthusiasm make the tours a fun and educational experience for the whole family.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
