/P 352 0 R
/E (In 1998, the Society undertook a major renovation, cleaning the structure, removing rust, and making it safe and presentable for public use. Since that time, SHS has invested more than $140,000 and innumerable volunteer hours in the ongoing care and upkeep of the Old Jail and its grounds. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
